    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## **Map Data to a List**\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Decide what your list will represent.\r\n   *Example: comments, tasks, songs, messages*\r\n\r\n2. Decide what one list item represents.\r\n   *Example: one comment or one task*\r\n\r\n3. Label each part of the list item with the kind of information it should show:\r\n\r\n   * avatar\r\n   * text 1\r\n   * text 2\r\n\r\n4. Make sure your labels match your topic.\r\n\r\n5. Save your work to your **Backpack** so you can use it in the next level.\r\n",
    "display_name": "List View",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Label the data needed for one list item, such as an avatar and text.",
